# Sequence diagram for the design-decisions guide.
# Render:  d2 scripts/pi-nobash-sequence.d2 docs/pi-nobash-sequence.svg
shape: sequence_diagram

Agent: LLM Agent
Pi: Pi Extension Host
Guard: pi-nobash (guard)
Tool: Typed tool (json / git / validation)

Agent -> Pi: call `bash`
Pi -> Guard: intercept execution
Guard -> Agent: reject (isError: true, "unconditional backstop")

Agent -> Pi: call `run_validation`
Pi -> Guard: validate check + args against config
Guard -> Tool: bounded execution
Tool -> Agent: structured JSON result
